{"c":{"284157":["Lucy","Female","b284157-cqYawN7XCNJx.jpg","Lucy is a mysterious netrunner from Night City. She is quite introverted and doesn't like to talk much about her past. Although she looks innocent, she won't hesitate to kill a person in a heartbeat if they tick her off.",8923],"284158":["David Martinez","Male","b284158-z1uGKC3IYVa1.png","David is a street kid from Arroyo, Santo Domingo in Night City, who is enrolled into Arasaka's educational system at Arasaka Academy. He lives with his mother Gloria in an apartment of Megabuilding H4.",5503],"284159":["Maine","Male","b284159-RvuKShSpDOS5.png","Maine used to be a military soldier before he became a mercenary. Now a veteran edgerunner in Night City, Maine dreams of \"making it big\", although he values his friendships with his crew more than his own glory.",1060],"284160":["Dorio","Female","b284160-pfwyNhxrsZOP.png","Dorio is a veteran edgerunner and Maine's right-hand. She's jacked and strong, but despite her tough exterior, Dorio has a soft side that she only shows to the people she trusts.",179],"284161":["Kiwi","Female","b284161-QlVuoXKKONLM.jpg","A member of Maine's crew of mercenaries, Kiwi is an enigmatic and snarky netrunner with a detachable cybernetic jaw. She also acts as a mentor to Lucy.",353],"284162":["Pilar","Male","b284162-KnRpkNpdbqx8.png","Pilar is an edgerunner of Night City, known to be a comical and crude techie who loves to show off. He and his sister, Rebecca, often team up with Maine and his crew to conduct mercenary jobs.",95],"284163":["Rebecca","Female","b284163-tt8smoAXl24x.jpg","Rebecca is an edgerunner of Night City, and is described as a short, spunky, trigger-happy solo who is always fighting with her brother Pilar. The two siblings often team up with Maine and his crew to conduct mercenary jobs.",5472],"284164":["Ripperdoc","Male","b284164-U9A3c65rl1il.png","",100],"284165":["Faraday","Male","b284165-sQpdUhtcWquN.jpg","Faraday is a ruthless fixer with ties to Militech and a distinctive optic cyberware that gives him four eyes. He is based in Santo Domingo and often employs Maine to conduct jobs.",45],"284166":["Gloria Martinez","Female","b284166-nB27pcRfIxvj.png","Both Gloria and her son David live in an apartment of Megabuilding H4 in Santo Domingo, Night City. She is an emergency medical technician (EMT).",212],"287410":["Katsuo Tanaka","Male","b287410-D2qGjLD3wPp0.jpg","",4],"287420":["Falco","Male","b287420-AzHYB6Sjt2Vj.jpg","Falco is a Nomad wheelman, and part of Maine's edgerunner crew.",321],"287421":["Kouchou","Male","b287421-oP973niJR4CQ.png","",1],"287422":["AI Kyoushi","Female","b287422-5v6TaeuzETtV.png","",1],"287424":["Gillean Jordan","Female","b287424-d8kIR8tQHSKe.png","",1],"287426":["Classmate","Male","default.jpg","",0],"287427":["Classmate","Male","default.jpg","",0],"287428":["Ishi","Male","default.jpg","",0],"287429":["Animals",null,"default.jpg","",0],"287430":["Animals",null,"default.jpg","",0],"287431":["Animals",null,"default.jpg","",1],"287433":["Trauma Team",null,"default.jpg","",0],"287434":["Trauma Team",null,"default.jpg","",0],"287435":["Trauma Team",null,"default.jpg","",1],"287436":["Trauma Team",null,"default.jpg","",2],"287439":["Jimmy Kurosaki","Male","b287439-lMrTnG8AWzg1.jpg","",14],"287440":["Ooya",null,"default.jpg","",1],"287442":["Tanaka","Male","b287442-8kfb2pqfqIiI.png","Katsuo's father and a high-ranking executive on the Arasaka Academy board.",1],"287443":["Medic","Female","b287443-WAVDonix3vdz.png","",2],"287444":["Laundry Machine AI",null,"default.jpg","",5],"287445":["Maxim Kuznetzov","Male","b287445-5sYdCbSyKvJm.png","Maxim Kuznetsov is a Solo working as a driver for the Arasaka Corporation",2],"287446":["Tyger Claws","Male","b287446-9zhFvCbqq3OZ.png","",1],"287447":["Tyger Claws","Male","b287447-LsiZeqjtIo7Y.png","",1],"287448":["Boxers",null,"default.jpg","",0],"287449":["Boxers",null,"default.jpg","",0],"287451":["Aldo","Male","b287451-1JCZGQndKaje.png","",1],"287452":["Cyberpsycho",